      "created_at": "2014-09-19T15:18:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Page 11 of the Enhanced Edition rulebook. Under the section labelled \"Advanced Play\"</p><blockquote><p>Two experienced players can play Sentinels of the Multiverse if one or both of them play as two heroes each.</p></blockquote><p>&nbsp;</p><p>However Vengeance villains are slightly different. At one point during playtesting, Christopher stated that he would like for the Vengeance villains to be balanced for 2 versus 2. Like all games of Sentinels of the Multiverse, different hero combinations will have an easier time than others.</p>",
